<title>INDIA: TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>$430,000 Indian Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) beat Orlin Stanoytchev (Bulgaria)</p>
<p>7-5 6-7 (6-8) 6-3</p>
<p>1-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Thomas Nydahl (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Marco Mengeschincheri (Italy) beat Lars Johnson (Sweden) 6-0</p>
<p>4-6 4-1, retired</p>
<p>Pat Cash (Australia) beat Mahesh Bhupathi (India) 6-1  6-3</p>
<p>Oleg Ogorodov (Uzbekistan) beat Jean-Philippe Fleurian (France)</p>
<p>6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Gaston Etlis (Argentina) beat Leander Paes (India) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Gerard Solves (France) beat Roberto Jabali (Brazil) 6-3 6-1.</p>
</text>
